<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3-mo BUBOR rate down 0.03 pt, 1-mo steady.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3-mo BUBOR rate down 0.03 pt, 1-mo steady.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) shed 0.03 percentage point for the three-month maturity but remained steady for the one month, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The BUBOR was fixed by the NBH at 23.50 percent for both the one-month and the three-month maturity.</p>
<p>The NBH began calculating BUBOR on August 1.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 266 2410</p>
